# Tree-sitter bindings - only exclude generated C/header files, not Go files.
# The grammars were renamed over time (tree_sitter_dart/ -> tree_sitter_external/
# -> internal/tree_sitter/); cover every historical path so the generated parser
# is excluded consistently across all releases.
internal/tree_sitter/**/*.c linguist-generated
internal/tree_sitter/**/*.h linguist-vendored
tree_sitter_dart/**/*.c linguist-generated
tree_sitter_dart/**/*.h linguist-vendored
tree_sitter_external/**/*.c linguist-generated
tree_sitter_external/**/*.h linguist-vendored

# Dependency lockfiles (generated by package managers).
**/package-lock.json linguist-generated
**/yarn.lock linguist-generated
**/pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated
**/go.sum linguist-generated
